    {
      "text": "WYNAUT can always be seen with a big, happy smile on its face. Look at its tail to determine if it is angry. When angered, this POKéMON will be slapping the ground with its tail.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "WYNAUT gather on moonlit nights to play by squeezing up against each other. By being squeezed, this POKéMON gains endurance and is trained to dole out powerful counterattacks.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A WYNAUT loves to eat sweet fruits. It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn by the fragrance.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
